WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.825
Operational context management starts with reusable patterns.

00:00:03.825 --> 00:00:07.970
Prompt templates, context logs, source inventories, reusable context packs,

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:11.005
and versioned summaries make large-context work more repeatable.

00:00:11.005 --> 00:00:14.465
A context pack might include current instructions, project assumptions,

00:00:14.465 --> 00:00:17.420
key source summaries, known constraints, and open questions.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.360
Versioning matters because context changes over time.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.730
Human review remains necessary.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.860
Large context can produce impressive summaries,

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.960
but reviewers should verify important claims against source material.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:30.860
Ask the model to ground claims in provided sources, cite sections when possible,

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.035
and state uncertainty.

00:00:32.035 --> 00:00:36.000
For professional workflows, the review process should include what material was included,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.775
what was excluded, and which assumptions shaped the answer.

00:00:38.775 --> 00:00:41.065
Privacy and sensitive data handling are central.

00:00:41.065 --> 00:00:45.520
Context may be logged, retained, displayed, sent to a provider, stored in chat history,

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:48.365
or reused by surrounding systems depending on the tool.

00:00:48.365 --> 00:00:52.670
Context minimization means including only what the task requires and avoiding unnecessary

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:53.170
secrets,

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:55.897
personal data, client information, or internal records.

00:00:55.897 --> 00:00:58.225
Large windows make it easier to overshare.

00:00:58.225 --> 00:01:01.400
Documenting assumptions and excluded material improves trust.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.280
If a summary is based on three policies but excludes two appendices, say so.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:08.395
If retrieved evidence came from a specific index, record it.

00:01:08.395 --> 00:01:10.440
If old context may be stale, mark it.

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:13.280
Good context operations make the model's working set visible,

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:16.080
so reviewers can understand the boundaries of the answer.
